WEBVTT

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:15.470
I, My, Me! Strawberry-eggs

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:13.560
A blue sky before the end of the rainy season

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:13.560
Tsuyu ake mae no aozora wa...

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:21.480
makes a heart dance with expectation

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:21.480
hitoashi hayaku kokoro wo odoraseru

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:28.960
Summer is coming yet again

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:28.960
Kotoshi mo mosugu natsuga kuru

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:37.390
The city and people are coming to life bursting with joy

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:37.390
Machi mo hito mo ukare kibun de zawameki dasu

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:46.510
A man who's grown up without losing his boyish heart

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:46.510
Shonen no kokoro no mama otona ni natta hito

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:55.240
We can't go back to the day we met for the first time, but...

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:55.240
Futari deatta anohi ni modorenai kedo...

00:00:57.380 --> 00:01:04.980
If I close my eyes, I can see your smiling face

00:00:57.380 --> 00:01:04.980
Hitomi wo tojireba hohoemu kao ga mieru

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:08.860
The song we both loved. Do you still sing it?

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:12.890
Daisuki na ano uta. Ima mo utatte masuka?

00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:20.730
I can still hear that gentle voice and melody

00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:20.730
Watashi ni wa kikoeru. Yasashii koe to melody

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:30.010
During times of sadness, I will remember you

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:30.010
Yowaki na toki hodo anata wo omoidasu

00:01:45.050 --> 00:01:46.020
Ouch!

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:51.660
You'll be fine.

00:01:56.210 --> 00:01:57.690
I feel strange.

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:12.760
What's wrong, Fuko?!

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:23.410
What is it!?

00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:30.290
Ghost!!

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:32.550
Wait!

00:02:33.830 --> 00:02:34.810
What's going on?!

00:02:34.810 --> 00:02:35.820
Are you all right?!

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:49.520
2nd Period
Forbidden Narrow Eyeliner

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:58.560
It's still early.

00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:04.140
Don't worry, I'll need only
5 minutes to get ready.

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:24.890
What are you doing?! Get up!!

00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:30.270
You are a woman starting
today, remember?

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:35.030
What does that have to do
with getting up early?

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:39.030
No matter how many hours a woman
has to get ready, it's never enough!

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:44.810
Get moving!!

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:57.940
What is this place?!

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:00.400
What's going on, Ba-chan?!

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:02.220
Just get going!

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:09.030
Now, try to finish the
makeup within 15 minutes.

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:11.270
You never know what may happen.

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:14.340
Blend the blush!
Don't cut corners!

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:16.940
Being a woman is such a hassle.

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:21.310
We have to prove to that man-hating
old hag that you're a good kyoshi.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:24.300
If she finds out you're a man,
you'll be fired on the spot.

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:26.950
You won't be able to pay rent,
and Kura-Ge will be Inu-nabe!

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:26.990
For Inu-Nabe

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:30.370
Now wait a minute!

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.190
Too much eyeliner!!

00:04:38.870 --> 00:04:41.670
Listen, this is going to be our secret.

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:42.820
All right?!

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:51.990
This is the third time that
peeping tom has appeared.

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:55.400
And always looking in Fuko's room.
Who is this pervert?!

00:04:55.640 --> 00:05:01.490
I don't really mind if he's human,
but what if it's a ghost!

00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:06.380
That's stupid, a human male is
a lot more frightening.

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:10.600
She's right. Men are such
nefarious creatures.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:13.290
I don't know.

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:15.910
I'm more scared of ghosts.

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:18.840
Either way, you don't have to worry.

00:05:19.110 --> 00:05:20.390
I know who the culprit is.

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:26.090
Shortcut to School

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:34.060
Gochiso

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:40.610
So, where's the new guy?

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:42.920
He already left.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:49.330
I'll have to get up half an hour
earlier to eat breakfast.

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:56.880
If you don't work you don't eat.

00:05:57.130 --> 00:05:58.970
Practice what you preach, old man.

00:05:58.970 --> 00:06:01.430
Ba-chan, I need some lead
for my mechanical pencil.

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:08.250
Is HB OK?

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:08.950
Yeah.

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:10.270
200 yen.

00:06:10.270 --> 00:06:11.050
Here.

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:16.030
The quiz in Uchida's English class today;
which page should I study?

00:06:16.590 --> 00:06:19.320
Page 24. Go over it.

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:21.030
Thanks, Ba-chan.

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:23.030
Ba-chan's hints
always hit the mark.

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:24.910
Yeah, you're great.

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:27.380
Just get going, I have a shop to tend.

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:28.380
Hey, let's go.

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:30.250
See you, Ba-chan.

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:32.130
We love you.

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:35.440
Stop teasing an old lady.

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:41.110
Who's the culprit?

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:43.010
The culprit?

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:44.730
Don't play dumb, pervert!!

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:46.440
What are you talking about?

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:48.150
You're not in cahoots, are you?

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:48.890
Huh?

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:51.160
Stop it, Fujio-chan.

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:53.130
It's not one of these people.

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:54.550
How do you know?

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:57.930
Because they let us use
this shortcut to school.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:06:59.690
So it must be a ghost!

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:04.420
Listen! I saw the peeping tom
escape into this place!

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:05.780
A peeping tom?

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:08.230
A side dish.

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:12.210
So you're the culprit!!

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:14.620
Fujio-san, you shouldn't
resort to violence.

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:18.700
I can't stand sneaky men!

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:25.550
The preliminary bell.

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:27.730
We'll settle this later.
We gotta go.

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:31.250
We'll be back!

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:33.440
Sorry about my friends.

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:36.180
Fujio-chan just has this crazy idea...

00:07:36.280 --> 00:07:37.590
Fuko!! My shoes!!

00:07:37.730 --> 00:07:39.770
Eh, good-bye.

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:41.490
Wait up!

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:45.480
I don't want any trouble in here!

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:47.480
Well?

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:57.230
Hello! As was already mentioned,
my name is Hibiki Amawa.

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:01.850
I don't have a lot to say now...

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:04.920
but I will get to know you
in my physical education classes.

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:07.620
As a male... Uh, female...
I believe that the best way to...

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:12.140
communicate, is to interact
closely with both body and mind.

00:08:12.140 --> 00:08:13.750
Interacting with body!

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:15.050
I'd love to do that!

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:16.660
Hibiki-chan!!

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:17.670
Be quiet!!

00:08:17.670 --> 00:08:20.030
Wow, thanks for the warm welcome.

00:08:24.590 --> 00:08:25.870
That's all for now!

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:29.290
Morning assembly is now over.

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:31.140
Return to your classrooms.

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:34.370
Principal's Office

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:34.070
Huh, a peeping tom?

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:37.690
Do you know the girls' dormitory
at the bottom of the hill?

00:08:38.070 --> 00:08:40.470
We received a call
from the housemother.

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:43.440
There have been
several appearances.

00:08:44.380 --> 00:08:48.050
Fortunately, no harm has come
to any of our students yet...

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:51.130
but we cannot leave the situation as is.

00:08:52.270 --> 00:08:56.430
Therefore, we would like you to
stay in the dorm for a while.

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:57.280
What!?

00:08:57.850 --> 00:08:59.980
The Principal feels, the housemother alone...

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:02.900
may not be able to protect
the students, should anything happen.

00:09:02.900 --> 00:09:04.810
But, no men are allowed in the dorm...

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:08.630
Of course not.
That's why we are asking you.

00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:10.070
But...

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:13.670
Amawa-sensei, why don't you
act more seriously?!

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:16.990
I understand.

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:24.570
Let's see. First, use the
make-up remover, and...

00:09:25.550 --> 00:09:28.080
It's gonna take a
while to get used to this.

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:30.690
Be a man and admit it!

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:32.830
You're the peeping tom, old man!

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:35.030
I don't know what you mean!

00:09:35.580 --> 00:09:37.280
We've got the goods on you!

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:39.590
I don't know! I don't know!

00:09:40.090 --> 00:09:42.390
Stop pretending you're innocent,
you peeping tom!

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:43.460
Wait a second.

00:09:45.590 --> 00:09:47.110
She's really scary.

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:49.080
It's OK.

00:09:49.490 --> 00:09:52.780
Hey, you can't just condemn
someone like that!

00:09:53.510 --> 00:09:54.400
You!

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:56.840
Oh, no! Does she recognize me?!

00:09:58.870 --> 00:09:59.710
Who are you?

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:02.840
I'm a resident here!!

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.040
Good! They don't recognize me.

00:10:06.030 --> 00:10:09.110
Oh, yeah? Then that makes you
one of the suspects.

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:12.630
Hey, you're saying
all residents are suspects?

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:13.130
Yep.

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:14.060
Why?

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:17.870
First, the man I chased
ran into this place.

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:21.370
Second, I did some
investigating today, and...

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:23.150
Ta-daa!

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:26.990
This was hidden in your backyard,
where we walk through every day.

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:27.810
What?

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:30.040
Taking pictures without
consent is a crime.

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:33.100
Well, that doesn't mean it was
a resident of this apartment.

00:10:33.550 --> 00:10:36.480
An old man like him could hardly sneak into your dorm.

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:39.470
And the other resident is just
an ordinary salary man.

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:40.620
And you?

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:42.520
Me?!

00:10:44.020 --> 00:10:44.720
I'm, uh, a kyoshi!

00:10:47.180 --> 00:10:49.270
We don't trust you
even if you are a kyoshi.

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:50.580
It's not me!

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:52.620
But you're a man.

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:56.790
Hey! This is starting
to make me mad!

00:10:56.910 --> 00:10:58.540
We're the ones who are mad!

00:10:58.770 --> 00:11:01.020
Don't you ever step
onto the dorm premises!

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:04.050
And looking in to
the windows is for-bid-den!

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:05.740
Oh, yeah!?

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:06.630
Then...

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:10.700
If you distrust us so much,
don't go beyond this line!

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:14.450
Old man, you belong over here!

00:11:15.280 --> 00:11:16.350
Fine!

00:11:16.350 --> 00:11:17.270
Oh, yeah?

00:11:17.270 --> 00:11:20.330
Stop it, everybody!
I know who it was!!

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:21.030
What?

00:11:21.190 --> 00:11:22.170
See, see!!

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:24.380
I found this in the library.

00:11:24.890 --> 00:11:28.360
There used to be executions held in the neighboring town.

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:29.870
Huh?

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:32.680
What's that got do with it?

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:34.580
Well, it's not far from here.

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:38.330
So what I saw must
have been a gho... gho... gho...

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:41.280
Oops!

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:44.050
Take your hands off of Fuko!

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:45.760
Fuko! Fuko!

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:47.010
Fuko-san, are you alright?

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:50.010
She's so weird, it's not even funny.

00:11:50.570 --> 00:11:51.450
Why?

00:12:03.920 --> 00:12:09.010
The Principal spoke to me about the
arrangement. Thank you for your help.

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:14.060
I'll get your room ready,
please wait here for a moment.

00:12:14.550 --> 00:12:16.030
Yes, thank you.

00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:36.040
Little brats...

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:39.650
Hello, sensei.

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:41.610
Nice to see you.

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:43.520
Are you gonna spend
the night here with us?

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:44.690
You're great, sensei.

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:46.040
It is very reassuring.

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:49.080
Well...

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:54.350
Girls! Don't be afraid!
I'll kick his dirty butt!

00:12:56.510 --> 00:12:59.700
Sensei, allow me to get you some tea.

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:02.770
If you don't mind
I'll have coffee, black.

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:03.470
Yes, ma'am.

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:05.600
We'll show you around later.

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:07.290
Why don't you just move in here?

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:09.320
Oh, good idea!

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:19.010
By the way, I heard Kuzuha got sick.

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:22.290
She has a fever and is in bed.

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:23.120
What?

00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:26.990
How can she be more scared
of a ghost than of a peeping tom?

00:13:29.600 --> 00:13:32.290
She'll be fine once she sees
it was the guys at Gochiso.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:37.170
Wait a minute, I think it's
too early to jump to that conclusion.

00:13:37.530 --> 00:13:41.380
No, there's no mistake.
My intuition tells me so.

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:44.100
I think that long-haired guy
is the most suspicious.

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:47.890
He's the type who's nice on the outside
and a pervert on the inside.

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:49.310
A pervert...

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:53.040
Yes, and his words and actions
were very childish for a kyoshi.

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:55.340
I'm sorry.

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:57.620
You don't have to be sorry, sensei.

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:03.110
Well, right. He sounds suspicious.

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:05.490
You girls can use the bath now.

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:06.260
Oh, OK.

00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:07.960
Thank you.

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:10.620
Say, you should join us.

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:14.770
Sure, we've got nothing
to hide from each other.

00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:16.920
Take a bath together...

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:25.550
Well, I already took one at home.

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:27.750
Oh, that's too bad.

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:31.720
You've got a nice body and I wanted
to have a sexy-body contest with you.

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:33.520
- Sensei, please.
- Take a bath with us.

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:34.260
- Sensei.
- Come on.

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:36.180
Just go take your baths!

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:42.490
Too much draft.
It'll chill my crotch.

00:14:52.400 --> 00:14:53.710
I'm an idiot.

00:14:54.390 --> 00:14:56.520
I'm not here to provoke
the peeping tom.

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:03.550
OK!!

00:15:04.010 --> 00:15:04.560
Sensei.

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:06.510
Do you have a second?

00:15:06.910 --> 00:15:08.140
Wait a second!

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:10.250
What's up?

00:15:10.770 --> 00:15:12.110
Sensei, Fuko is...

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:23.640
I missed lunch, so...

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:28.280
And, what's with Kuzuha?

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:33.460
Oh yeah, Fuko is so shaken
she's having nightmares.

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:35.550
Keeps groaning about ghosts.

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:38.010
Could you sleep with her?

00:15:39.860 --> 00:15:42.360
Well, that's...

00:15:43.050 --> 00:15:45.730
What about you, Himejima?
Or Umeda?

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:49.300
No, Miho and I have to
take turns standing watch.

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:50.850
Please, sensei!

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:18.610
Two times one is two,
two times two is four...

00:16:18.610 --> 00:16:20.780
two times three is six,
two times four is eight...

00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:22.800
two times five is ten,
two times six is twelve...

00:16:30.730 --> 00:16:32.710
Ah, no, that's my...

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:35.580
Sorry, Kuzuha!

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:36.630
I did it.

00:16:42.340 --> 00:16:43.850
I ran.

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:51.140
Sensei...

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:53.510
Thank you.

00:17:03.570 --> 00:17:05.500
Being a kyoshi is great.

00:17:08.950 --> 00:17:09.990
Who's there?!

00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:11.930
Ciao!

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:12.790
Ciao.

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:16.260
The peeping tom!!

00:17:23.050 --> 00:17:24.260
You've got to be kidding.

00:17:24.580 --> 00:17:25.260
Sensei.

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:27.330
Kuzuha!

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:32.370
You saw it? The gho... gho... gho...

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:34.610
Oh, no, no, there's no ghost!

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:36.900
Over here! Quick, girls!

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:39.870
You just stay here! OK?!

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:47.100
There's no mistake!
I saw him run into Gochiso!!

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:47.950
Let's go!

00:17:49.510 --> 00:17:51.450
Oh, no! Wait a second!

00:17:54.430 --> 00:17:55.240
Oh, no!

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:58.640
That was a ghost, but the people
in Gochiso are going to be in trouble!

00:17:58.640 --> 00:17:59.910
I have to warn them!

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:05.690
Oh please, old man!

00:18:13.430 --> 00:18:15.030
Ouch!

00:18:45.670 --> 00:18:47.790
Everybody! Please get away!

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:49.340
Fuko! What are you saying?

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:51.530
Please get away quickly!

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:55.320
Gochiso

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:05.850
Those are pictures of us!

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:08.580
And those are Fuko-san dolls!

00:19:10.990 --> 00:19:12.060
I see.

00:19:12.590 --> 00:19:13.890
So it's your camera!

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:15.640
And the old man's the peeping tom!

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:20.570
No, I merely find art in
young girls' school uniforms.

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:23.640
Kochi is a big fan of Fuko.
Did you know?

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:26.000
Huh? Kochi?

00:19:26.110 --> 00:19:28.770
Written as "Tofu",
but read as "Kochi".

00:19:30.880 --> 00:19:32.320
That's my name.

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:37.850
Get them!!

00:19:47.820 --> 00:19:49.290
Oh, boy.

00:19:56.490 --> 00:19:57.950
Why me?

00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:04.680
Men really are all perverts!

00:20:05.130 --> 00:20:07.370
How can they be such morons?

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:14.630
Ba-chan, I need a notebook.

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:16.950
- "I'm sorry. I won't do it again."
- "I'm sorry."

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:18.440
Here you go. 100 yen.

00:20:31.110 --> 00:20:34.090
That was some night, wasn't it?

00:20:35.740 --> 00:20:40.790
Sensei, are all men like them?

00:20:41.330 --> 00:20:43.890
Well, I don't know; probably not.

00:20:43.890 --> 00:20:47.910
There are all kinds of men,
not every one is like them.

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:56.100
You must be right, they all must
be nice at heart, too.

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:59.380
Yeah, you don't have to worry.

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:02.040
I hope...

00:21:11.260 --> 00:21:18.010
At the train station after school
that's where I look for you

00:21:11.260 --> 00:21:18.010
Hokago no eki kimi wo sagasu.

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:27.370
With my racing heart
can I find you again today?

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:27.370
Doki doki shiteru
kyo mo aeru kana?

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:49.330
At this train station
I saw you many times before

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:49.330
Eki no homu de
mikakete ta kimi.

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:56.220
But couldn't talk to you
Not at all

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:56.220
Hajime wa nanimo hanase nakatta.

00:21:56.370 --> 00:22:03.070
Will I find you again tomorrow?

00:21:56.370 --> 00:22:03.070
Moshimo ashita aetara iina?

00:22:03.210 --> 00:22:11.050
Maybe I'll have enough
courage to talk to you

00:22:03.210 --> 00:22:11.050
Youki dashite ieru kamone.

00:22:11.240 --> 00:22:18.180
Even if the sky cries

00:22:11.240 --> 00:22:18.180
Tatoeba sora ga namida shitemo...

00:22:18.180 --> 00:22:27.020
with your smile it's
a sunny day in my eyes

00:22:18.180 --> 00:22:27.020
kimi no egao de hitomi wa hareru yo.

00:22:38.440 --> 00:22:53.480
Third Period "Selfish Blush Magic"

00:22:38.660 --> 00:22:42.340
Today, we need to decide on a name
for the bunny we have here.

00:22:42.690 --> 00:22:44.730
Please speak up if you have an idea.

00:22:44.730 --> 00:22:45.680
Hey, Seiko.

00:22:45.680 --> 00:22:47.700
"Hey-Sei-Ko".
Any other ideas?

00:22:47.700 --> 00:22:48.440
Nande ya nen.

00:22:49.620 --> 00:22:50.820
Any other ideas?

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:52.500
Way to go, Kasuganomichi!
